# Public build-time setting; never put credentials here.
# Leave unset for local development: current browser hostname, API port 5000.
# For a separate same-site API host, set the exact HTTPS origin:
# REACT_APP_API_URL=https://api.your-approved-domain.example
# An explicit empty value uses the current origin (the prepared Nginx proxy).
# REACT_APP_API_URL=
